OL,6,
OL,7,FThe crash happened near Cresthaven,
OL,8,Fsome nine miles (14 km) from
OL,9,FMar-a-Lago, President Donald Trump's
OL,10,Fresort
OL,12,FFlight analysis reveals the business
OL,13,Faircraft was plummeting hundreds of
OL,14,Ffeet per second
